  "notes": "{縫|ぬ}う means to sew or stitch with needle and thread.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Takes を particle: ボタンを{縫|ぬ}う\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {縫|ぬ}い{物|もの}: sewing, needlework\n- {縫|ぬ}い{目|め}: seam, stitch\n- {縫|ぬ}い{付|つ}ける: to sew on\n- {手縫|てぬ}い: hand-sewn\n- ミシンで{縫|ぬ}う: to sew with a sewing machine\n\nMETAPHORICAL USE:\n{人混|ひとご}みを{縫|ぬ}う (to weave through a crowd) - moving in a zigzag pattern like a needle through fabric.",
